      "content": "i see. i guess im just struggling with the \"real\" part of it. some people i know argue that these concepts aren't actually based on objective facts but are just political ideas or ways to make people feel bad. if she asks me why we should focus on these things instead of just treating everyone the same, what's the most honest answer? is \"treating everyone the same\" not the goal?",
